# Run directories are evidence, not source: a single run carries node data directories,
# per-node JSON Lines logs and chain state, which is far too large and far too
# machine-specific to version. The directory itself is kept so a run has somewhere to land.
/*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# The reading guide is the exception: it is documentation that happens to live beside
# the evidence, not evidence. Its rules — §9 in particular — are what keep the next
# reader from misreading a column, so they have to travel with the code that produces
# those columns.
!GUIDA-STATISTICHE-E-GRAFICI.md
# Of each run only the analysis tree is versioned: it is what the thesis cites, and it
# can be regenerated from the raw run only on the machine that still holds it. Everything
# else in the run directory (chains/, logs/, manifests, archives) stays local. The
# per-miner private/*.log files inside analysis/ remain excluded by the root *.log rule.
!/run-*/
/run-*/*
!/run-*/analysis/
